# Purpose
# Start or reuse localhost and check important generated routes.
#
# Common usage
# Run from the repository root.
# .\scripts\smoke-pages.ps1
# .\scripts\smoke-pages.ps1 -SkipBuild -Port 4000
# .\scripts\smoke-pages.ps1 -Port 4001 -BindAddress 127.0.0.1
#
# Useful options
# -SkipBuild checks the current _site folder.
# -Port chooses the localhost port.
# -BindAddress chooses the local bind address.
# -StartupTimeoutSeconds changes how long to wait for the server.
#
# Recommended next command
# .\scripts\verify-browser-pages.ps1 -BaseUri http://127.0.0.1:4000
#
# Notes
# The script verifies that the server is serving fresh _site output.
# It stops only the temporary server it started.
